# erpnext-qa

QA automation portfolio project for [ERPNext](https://github.com/frappe/erpnext) v15.

## Goal

Test a real, self-hosted ERP across three surfaces: the REST API, the web UI and the database. The aim is a clean, readable suite with a CI pipeline, a test strategy and measured results.

## Stack

- TypeScript (strict) and Playwright Test, for API and E2E tests
- MariaDB checks with SQL
- ERPNext v15 running locally with Docker
- GitHub Actions for CI
- ESLint and Prettier

## Status

In progress. The repository skeleton is ready; the environment and the tests come next.

## How AI was used

AI was used only to explain concepts and review pull requests. All test code is written by the author.
